## Lore

Butter Trolls are short, pudgy D-Bees of unknown origin who keep no
records of where they came from. They are named for the thick, yellow,
butter-like sweat that coats them and for their resemblance to the fat
trolls of legend: big hairy pointed ears, balding heads with long greasy
hair at the back, pig-like noses, bad teeth, small claws and pale,
pockmarked skin.

They turn up in cities and the ''Burbs, holed up in basements walled
with screens and terminals. They have a real gift for machines and
computers but little drive to use it, preferring to tinker, play games
and read technical journals. Self-indulgent, lazy and often cowardly,
they like to think themselves smarter than everyone else, a cover for
deep insecurity. Many find work as Operators and engineers, or with the
tech makers of Upper Michigan, Naruni Enterprises, the Black Market and
assorted mercenary outfits. Real monster races resent them as posers, and
they are jealous of anyone handsome and successful.
', 'published', 'data-script'
